---
title: "track_referral (flash_loan.move)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_qualified: referral.is_qualified_to_create_referral_code(who)
    q_check_qualified --> [*]: already_qualified == true (early return)
    q_check_qualified --> q_get_decimals: already_qualified == false
    q_get_decimals --> q_get_price: decimals = coin_decimals_registry.decimals(token_type)
    q_get_price --> q_calc_value: usd_price = get_price(x_oracle, token_type, usd(), clock)
    q_calc_value --> q_increase: collateral_value_usd = coin_value(usd_price, from(token_amount), decimals)
    q_increase --> [*]: referral.increase_usd_qualification(who, collateral_value_usd.floor())

    note right of q_check_qualified
        INV-001: Early return if user is already qualified - idempotent for qualified users
    end note

    note right of q_get_price
        INV-002: Price is always denominated in USD (x_oracle::usd())
        INV-003: Oracle price could be stale or manipulated within same transaction
    end note

    note right of q_calc_value
        INV-004: coin_value converts token_amount to USD using oracle price and decimals
        INV-005: floor() truncates fractional USD value for qualification tracking
    end note

    note right of q_increase
        INV-006: Qualification is cumulative - each flash loan repay increases USD qualification
        INV-007: Uses loan amount not repay amount for qualification calculation
    end note
